        </Shape>

        <!-- POSSESSION — share of the ball, drawn as the split itself. The fill
             is the LEFT side's colour over a track in the right's, its width
             mapped 0-100 into 0-620 by a range mapper. Bind the RECTANGLE, not
             the Shape: width is on ParametricPath and the Shape has none.

             THE BAR IS THE WHOLE ROW NOW. Possession used to be a fourth line
             of the team table as well — "50 Possession 50" under Saves — which
             was the same two numbers the bar already had ends for, printed
             again in a column of unrelated counts. The bar keeps the numbers
             and takes the word: `possessionLabel` sits centred between them,
             on the same baseline, so the three read as one line under it. -->
        <Text x="146" y="348" sizingValue="autoWidth" originX="0" originY="0.5" name="Left Pct" id="2:3200">
