            <!-- THE WAVE RUNS AT REST — no inputs, no conditions, one state
                 holding a looping timeline. It keeps turning over while the
                 stamp is invisible, which costs a float a frame and means the
                 crest is already mid-word on the frame the stamp fades in
                 rather than starting from the first character. -->
